post_install() {
  cat <<'NOTICE'
x810-device-support installed. It does not enable or start services during
package installation. The image profile explicitly enables the validated
thermal limiter, GNOME device controls, power-profile API, charge-limit restore,
and Bluetooth address provisioner; manual recovery remains opt-in.
NOTICE
}

post_upgrade() {
  :
}
